## ActionType: 生成恢复报告

生成恢复操作的完整报告，包括恢复状态、数据统计、时效评估。

### Operation Config

```yaml
operation_config:
  type: object
```


### Bound Object

| Bound Object |
|--------------|
| recovery_job |

### Affect Object

| Affect Object | Affect Description |
|---------------|--------------------|

### Impact Contracts

```yaml
impact_contracts:
  - object_type_id: recovery_task
    expected_operation: add
    description: ""
```


### Trigger Condition

```yaml
object_type_id: recovery_job
field: recovery_result
operation: ==
value: success
```


